// common.hc++
//
// Shared constants and data structures for the self hosted HolyC++
// toolchain: token kinds, AST node kinds, type kinds, and the Token,
// TokenList, Node and NodeList classes that lexer.hc++, parser.hc++
// and interpreter.hc++ all build on.
//
// HolyC++ (as implemented by bootstrap/hcrun.c) only has fixed size
// arrays, there is no dynamic growth built into the language. Every
// list here therefore reserves a generous fixed capacity up front.
// This is a known, documented limit of the self hosted toolchain, see
// README.md.

// ---- token kinds --------------------------------------------------

